1 0 0 1 54 730 Tm
([Abstract]) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 702 Tm
(Attention Is All You Need) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 669 Tm
(Authors: Ashish Vaswani, Noam Shazeer, Niki Parmar, Jakob Uszkoreit, Llion Jones,) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 654 Tm
(Aidan N. Gomez, Lukasz Kaiser, Illia Polosukhin \(2017\)) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 621 Tm
(Abstract: The dominant sequence transduction models are based on complex recurrent) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 606 Tm
(or convolutional neural networks that include an encoder and a decoder. The best) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 591 Tm
(performing models also connect the encoder and decoder through an attention) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 576 Tm
(mechanism. We propose a new simple network architecture, the Transformer, based) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 561 Tm
(solely on attention mechanisms, dispensing with recurrence and convolutions) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 546 Tm
(entirely.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 513 Tm
(Experiments on two machine translation tasks show these models to be superior in) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 498 Tm
(quality while being more parallelizable and requiring significantly less time to) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 483 Tm
(train. Our model achieves 28.4 BLEU on the WMT 2014 English-to-German translation) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 468 Tm
(task, improving over the existing best results, including ensembles, by over 2 BLEU.) Tj
ET
endstream
endobj
