([Positional Encoding & Experimental Results]) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 702 Tm
(3.5 Positional Encoding: Since our model contains no recurrence and no convolution,) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 687 Tm
(in order for the model to make use of the order of the sequence, we must inject some) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 672 Tm
(information about the relative or absolute position of the tokens in the sequence.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 657 Tm
(We use sine and cosine functions of different frequencies added to the input) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 642 Tm
(embeddings.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 609 Tm
(5.1 Machine Translation Results: On the WMT 2014 English-to-German translation task,) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 594 Tm
(the big Transformer model \(Transformer big\) outperforms the best previously reported) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 579 Tm
(models including ensembles by more than 2.0 BLEU, establishing a new) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 564 Tm
(state-of-the-art BLEU score of 28.4 after training for 3.5 days on 8 P100 GPUs.) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 531 Tm
(On the WMT 2014 English-to-French translation task, our big model achieves a BLEU) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 516 Tm
(score of 41.8, outperforming all of the previously published single models, at less) Tj
1 0 0 1 54 501 Tm
(than 1/4 the training cost of the previous state-of-the-art model.) Tj
ET
endstream
